cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use rendehR, please cite the preprint in preferred-citation."
title: "rendehR: Multi-Source EHR Harmonization Pipeline"
version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  Downloads, imports, cohort-filters, and harmonizes ICU electronic health
  record data from MIMIC-III, MIMIC-IV, and eICU into analysis-ready flat,
  time-series and duration tables.
